      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 18,
      "strokeColor": "#0b2545",
      "text": "Alertmanager — ทำไมไม่ให้ Prometheus ส่งอีเมลเองเลย?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "pr",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 175,
      "height": 110,
      "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff",
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "Prometheus\n\nประเมิน rule\nแล้วส่ง alert ที่\nfiring ออกมา"
      },
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "msukbccleb7rqxbfik9",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 240,
      "y": 110,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 200,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "msukbcclafnloe3zt3e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 258,
      "y": 122,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "text": "Alertmanager — งานทั้งหมดอยู่ที่นี่",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 258,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 130,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "1. Dedup\n\nalert เดียวกัน\nจากหลาย\nPrometheus\nรวมเป็นใบเดียว"
      },
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 130,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "2. Group\n\n50 container\nล่มพร้อมกัน\n= แจ้ง 1 ใบ\nไม่ใช่ 50 ใบ"
      },
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d3",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 562,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 140,
      "height": 130,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "3. Inhibit\n\nถ้าทั้งเครื่องล่ม\nแล้ว ก็ไม่ต้อง\nเตือนว่าแอป\nบนเครื่องช้า"
      },
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d4",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 714,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 150,
      "height": 130,
      "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "4. Silence\n\nช่วง maintenance\nปิดเสียงชั่วคราว\nโดยไม่ต้องแก้\n rule"
      },
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "rt",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 915,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 225,
      "height": 75,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff",
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "5. Route\nเลือกปลายทางตาม label\nเช่น severity"
      },
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-15T16:00:22.344Z",
